      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Thermal Defenders have been hard at work melting the snow in Atlas Park."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Super Packs no longer drop Experience Boosters instead of Experienced."
    },
    {
      "category": "Geometry",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed bartap LOD at distance that has been broken for a long time"
    },
    {
      "category": "Geometry",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed bartaps being sunk too low on maps and supergroup bases."
    },
    {
      "category": "Geometry",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "This fix is transparent to anyone who left the bartaps alone in their bases. If you moved or added any after the page3 release, you will unfortunately have to re-position them again. We do apologize for this issue."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed missing visual FX for the Holiday Event version of the Snowball temporary power."
    },
    {
